	"system": {
		"description": "<p>When you choose this archetype at 3rd level you gain proficiency in Performance, as well as your choice of Intimidation or Persuasion. If you are already proficient in either skill, you gain an expertise die. In addition, you gain additional skill specialties equal to your proficiency bonus, and you gain another specialty whenever your proficiency bonus increases. These bonus specialties must be in Performance or the chosen skill.</p>",
